---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Legal - Accustra Internet Pvt Ltd"
  description="Legal information and privacy policy for Accustra Internet Pvt Ltd."
>
  <article class="legal-article">
    <header class="page-header">
      <h1 class="page-title">Legal Information & Privacy Policy</h1>
    </header>

    <div class="legal-content">
      <h2>1. Overview</h2>
      <p>
        Accustra Internet Pvt Ltd ("Accustra", "we", "us", or "our") respects
        your privacy and is committed to protecting your personal data. This
        privacy policy informs you about how we handle your data, your privacy
        rights, and how the law protects you.
      </p>

      <h2>2. Data Collection & Privacy First Philosophy</h2>
      <p>
        We believe in performance and privacy. We do not use intrusive tracking
        scripts or third-party advertising trackers. We utilize privacy-friendly
        analytics solution (<a
          href="https://analytics.google.com/"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer">Google Analytics</a
        >) which does not use cookies and complies with GDPR, CCPA, and ePrivacy
        directives. Google Analytics is used to improve the user experience of
        the website.
      </p>

      <h2>3. Intellectual Property</h2>
      <p>
        All content, branding, logos, graphics, and code on this website are the
        property of Accustra Internet Pvt Ltd unless explicitly noted otherwise.
      </p>

      <h2>4. Contact Us</h2>
      <p>
        If you have any questions regarding these legal terms, please reach out
        via our <a href="/contact">Contact Page</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>

<style>
  .page-title {
    font-size: 40px;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 30px;
  }

  .legal-content h2 {
    font-size: 24px;
    margin-top: 30px;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .legal-content p {
    font-size: 18px;
    color: #cccccc;
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .legal-content a {
    color: #ffffff;
  }
</style>
